#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:273
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Zammad"
msgstr "Zammad installieren"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:275
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper ref\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper install zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"===CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo yum install zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Due to an issue with packager.io, you'll need to correct file permissions for public files on CentOS:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chmod -R 755 /opt/zammad/public/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
