"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper ref\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper install zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"===CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo yum install zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Aufgrund eines Problems mit packager.io müssen Sie die Dateiberechtigungen für öffentliche Dateien unter CentOS korrigieren:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chmod -R 755 /opt/zammad/public/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:321
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Services of Zammad"
msgstr "Zammad Services verwalten"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:324
msgid ""
"Zammad uses three services. These services can be managed individually or "
"all at once by using the parent **zammad**."
msgstr ""
"Zammad verwendet drei Dienste. Diese Dienste können einzeln oder alle auf "
"einmal verwaltet werden, indem der übergeordnete Dienst **zammad** verwendet "
"wird."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:329
msgid "zammad: includes the services below"
msgstr "zammad: umfasst die folgenden Dienste"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:329
msgid ""
"**zammad-web**: internal puma server (relevant for displaying the web app)"
msgstr ""
"**zammad-web**: interner Puma-Server (relevant für die Anzeige der "
"Webanwendung)"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:329
msgid ""
"**zammad-worker**: background worker - relevant for all delayed- and "
"background jobs"
msgstr ""
"**zammad-worker**: Hintergrund-Worker - relevant für alle verzögerten "
"Aufgaben sowie Hintergrundaufgaben"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:329
msgid "**zammad-websocket**: websocket server for session related information"
msgstr ""
"**zammad-websocket**: Websocket-Server für sitzungsbezogene Informationen"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:331
msgid ""
"Manage the services with `systemctl`'s commands `start`, `restart`, `stop`, "
"`status`."
msgstr ""
"Verwalten Sie die Dienste mit den `systemctl`-Befehlen `start`, `restart`, "
"`stop`, `status`."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:333
msgid "Example to start Zammad with all sub-services:"
msgstr "Beispiel für den Start von Zammad mit allen Diensten:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:334
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:170 src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:169
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo systemctl start zammad\n"
msgstr "sudo systemctl start zammad\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:339
msgid ""
"To stop or restart a service or to check its status, adjust the command as "
"mentioned above."
msgstr ""
"Um einen Dienst anzuhalten, neu zu starten oder dessen Status zu prüfen, "
"passen Sie den Befehl wie oben beschrieben an."

