#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:1
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:6
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Elasticsearch 7"
msgstr "Elasticsearch 7 installieren"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:13
msgid ""
"Elasticsearch is technically not required to run Zammad, but _highly_ "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"Elasticsearch ist technisch nicht erforderlich, um Zammad auszuführen, wird "
"aber _dringend_ empfohlen."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:18
msgid ""
"Elasticsearch offers different versions. Currently, the versions 7, 8 and 9 "
"are supported by Zammad. For installation instructions, you should first and "
"foremost follow [Elastic's installation documentation](https://"
"www.elastic.co/docs/deploy-manage/deploy/self-managed/installing-"
"elasticsearch){target=_blank}.  Use the dropdown in the top right corner to "
"choose which version you want to install."
msgstr ""
"Elasticsearch bietet verschiedene Versionen an. Derzeit werden die Versionen "
"7, 8 und 9 von Zammad unterstützt. Für die Installationsanweisungen sollten "
"Sie in erster Linie der [Installations-Dokumentation](https://www.elastic.co/"
"docs/deploy-manage/deploy/self-managed/installing-elasticsearch)"
"{target=_blank} folgen.  Verwenden Sie das Dropdown-Menü in der oberen "
"rechten Ecke, um die Version auszuwählen, die Sie installieren möchten."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:22
msgid ""
"However, if you want go with Elasticsearch 7 (which is slightly easier to "
"install), you can find the consolidated installation steps below. Be aware "
"that the maintenance of version 7 might be stopped earlier than for later "
"versions, which also come with some additional security features."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie jedoch Elasticsearch 7 verwenden möchten (das etwas einfacher zu "
"installieren ist), finden Sie unten die konsolidierten "
"Installationsschritte. Beachten Sie, dass die Wartung von Version 7 "
"möglicherweise früher eingestellt wird als bei darauffolgenden Versionen, "
"die außerdem einige zusätzliche Sicherheitsfunktionen enthalten."

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you install Elasticsearch >= 8 and want to follow our\n"
"[standard configuration](/en/tutorials/connect-config-elasticsearch), make sure to copy/save the password which is\n"
"shown during the installation of Elasticsearch.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie Elasticsearch >= 8 installieren und unserer\n"
"[Standardkonfiguration](/de/tutorials/connect-config-elasticsearch) folgen wollen, stellen Sie sicher, dass Sie das Passwort kopieren/speichern, das\n"
"während der Installation von Elasticsearch angezeigt wird.\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"==== Ubuntu/Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install apt-transport-https sudo wget curl gnupg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"curl -fsSL https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch | \\\n"
"gpg --dearmor | sudo tee /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/elasticsearch.gpg> /dev/null\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"==== Ubuntu/Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install apt-transport-https sudo wget curl gnupg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"curl -fsSL https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch | \\\n"
"gpg --dearmor | sudo tee /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/elasticsearch.gpg> /dev/null\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Deb822 format\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Deb822 Format\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs|tabs|info)
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this tab, the repository is added by using the\n"
"[deb822 format](https://repolib.readthedocs.io/en/latest/deb822-format.html).\n"
"If you run a distribution which doesn't support it, use the legacy format instead.\n"
msgstr ""
"In diesem Tab wird das Repository mit im\n"
"[deb822-Format](https://repolib.readthedocs.io/en/latest/deb822-format.html)\n"
"hinzugefügt. Wenn Sie eine Distribution einsetzen, die dieses Format nicht unterstützt,\n"
"verwenden Sie stattdessen das Legacy-Format.\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs|tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"printf \"Types: deb\n"
"URIs: https://artifacts.elastic.co/packages/7.x/apt\n"
"Suites: stable\n"
"Components: main\n"
"Signed-By: /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/elasticsearch.gpg\" | \\\n"
"sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/elastic-7.x.sources > /dev/null\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Legacy format\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"echo \"deb [signed-by=/etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/elasticsearch.gpg] https://artifacts.elastic.co/packages/7.x/apt stable main\"| \\\n"
"sudo tee -a /etc/apt/sources.list.d/elastic-7.x.list > /dev/null\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"printf \"Types: deb\n"
"URIs: https://artifacts.elastic.co/packages/7.x/apt\n"
"Suites: stable\n"
"Components: main\n"
"Signed-By: /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/elasticsearch.gpg\" | \\\n"
"sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/elastic-7.x.sources > /dev/null\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Legacy Format\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"echo \"deb [signed-by=/etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/elasticsearch.gpg] https://artifacts.elastic.co/packages/7.x/apt stable main\"| \\\n"
"sudo tee -a /etc/apt/sources.list.d/elastic-7.x.list > /dev/null\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"==== OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rpm --import https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"echo \"[elasticsearch-7.x]\n"
"name=Elasticsearch repository for 7.x packages\n"
"baseurl=https://artifacts.elastic.co/packages/7.x/yum\n"
"gpgcheck=1\n"
"gpgkey=https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch\n"
"enabled=1\n"
"autorefresh=1\n"
"type=rpm-md\"| sudo tee /etc/zypp/repos.d/elasticsearch-7.x.repo\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper install elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"==== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rpm --import https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"echo \"[elasticsearch-7.x]\n"
"name=Elasticsearch repository for 7.x packages\n"
"baseurl=https://artifacts.elastic.co/packages/7.x/yum\n"
"gpgcheck=1\n"
"gpgkey=https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch\n"
"enabled=1\n"
"autorefresh=1\n"
"type=rpm-md\"| sudo tee /etc/yum.repos.d/elasticsearch-7.x.repo\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo yum install -y elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"==== Direct Download\n"
"\n"
"Find the latest release on the [downloads page](https://www.elastic.co/downloads/elasticsearch) or see the\n"
"[installation guide](https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/install-elasticsearch.html)\n"
"for in-depth instructions.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"==== OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rpm --import https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"echo \"[elasticsearch-7.x]\n"
"name=Elasticsearch repository for 7.x packages\n"
"baseurl=https://artifacts.elastic.co/packages/7.x/yum\n"
"gpgcheck=1\n"
"gpgkey=https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch\n"
"enabled=1\n"
"autorefresh=1\n"
"type=rpm-md\"| sudo tee /etc/zypp/repos.d/elasticsearch-7.x.repo\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper install elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"==== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rpm --import https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"echo \"[elasticsearch-7.x]\n"
"name=Elasticsearch repository for 7.x packages\n"
"baseurl=https://artifacts.elastic.co/packages/7.x/yum\n"
"gpgcheck=1\n"
"gpgkey=https://artifacts.elastic.co/GPG-KEY-elasticsearch\n"
"enabled=1\n"
"autorefresh=1\n"
"type=rpm-md\"| sudo tee /etc/yum.repos.d/elasticsearch-7.x.repo\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo yum install -y elasticsearch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"==== Direkter Download\n"
"\n"
"Sie finden das neueste Release auf der [Download Seite](https://www.elastic.co/downloads/elasticsearch) und eine\n"
"[Installationsanleitung](https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/install-elasticsearch.html)\n"
"für weitergehende Informationen.\n"
"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:134
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the ingest-attachment plugin:\n"
":   ```sh\n"
"    /usr/share/elasticsearch/bin/elasticsearch-plugin install ingest-attachment\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"Installieren Sie das Plugin \"ingest-attachment\":\n"
":   ```sh\n"
"    /usr/share/elasticsearch/bin/elasticsearch-plugin install ingest-attachment\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:143
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Increase Virtual Memory Map Limit:\n"
":   ```sh\n"
"    sudo sysctl -w vm.max_map_count=262144\n"
"    ```\n"
"<!-- markdownlint-disable MD046 -->\n"
"Adjust `/etc/elasticsearch/elasticsearch.yml`:\n"
":   ```\n"
"    # /etc/elasticsearch/elasticsearch.yml\n"
msgstr ""
"Erhöhen Sie das Virtual Memory Map Limit:\n"
":   ```sh\n"
"    sudo sysctl -w vm.max_map_count=262144\n"
"    ```\n"
"<!-- markdownlint-disable MD046 -->\n"
"Passen Sie `/etc/elasticsearch/elasticsearch.yml` an:\n"
":   ```\n"
"    # /etc/elasticsearch/elasticsearch.yml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:154
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # Tickets above this size (articles + attachments + metadata)\n"
"    # may fail to be properly indexed (Default: 100mb).\n"
"    #\n"
"    # When Zammad sends tickets to Elasticsearch for indexing,\n"
"    # it bundles together all the data on each individual ticket\n"
"    # and issues a single HTTP request for it.\n"
"    # Payloads exceeding this threshold will be truncated.\n"
"    #\n"
"    # Performance may suffer if it is set too high.\n"
"    http.max_content_length: 400mb\n"
msgstr ""
"    # Tickets above this size (articles + attachments + metadata)\n"
"    # may fail to be properly indexed (Default: 100mb).\n"
"    #\n"
"    # When Zammad sends tickets to Elasticsearch for indexing,\n"
"    # it bundles together all the data on each individual ticket\n"
"    # and issues a single HTTP request for it.\n"
"    # Payloads exceeding this threshold will be truncated.\n"
"    #\n"
"    # Performance may suffer if it is set too high.\n"
"    http.max_content_length: 400mb\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:164
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # Allows the engine to generate larger (more complex) search queries.\n"
"    # Elasticsearch will raise an error or deprecation notice if this value is\n"
"    # too low, but setting it too high can overload system\n"
"    # resources (Default: 1024).\n"
"    #\n"
"    # Available in version 6.6+ only.\n"
"    indices.query.bool.max_clause_count: 2000\n"
"    ```\n"
"<!-- markdownlint-enable MD046 -->\n"
msgstr ""
"    # Allows the engine to generate larger (more complex) search queries.\n"
"    # Elasticsearch will raise an error or deprecation notice if this value is\n"
"    # too low, but setting it too high can overload system\n"
"    # resources (Default: 1024).\n"
"    #\n"
"    # Available in version 6.6+ only.\n"
"    indices.query.bool.max_clause_count: 2000\n"
"    ```\n"
"<!-- markdownlint-enable MD046 -->\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:169
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Enable it by default and start it:\n"
":   ```sh\n"
"    sudo systemctl enable elasticsearch --now\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"Aktivieren Sie es standardmäßig und starten Sie es:\n"
":   ```sh\n"
"    sudo systemctl enable elasticsearch --now\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:173
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" Go on with\n"
" [connecting Elasticsearch with Zammad](/en/tutorials/connect-config-elasticsearch).\n"
msgstr ""
" Fahren Sie fort indem Sie\n"
" [Elasticsearch mit Zammad verbinden](/de/tutorials/connect-config-elasticsearch).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:1 src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate Zammad to New Host"
msgstr "Zammad zu einem neuen Host migrieren"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:14
msgid ""
"This is just a description of basic steps to perform a migration to a new "
"host. Your environment may be different so you should consider this as a "
"reference point only. If anything goes wrong, please consult the [Zammad "
"Community](https://community.zammad.org/c/trouble-running-zammad-this-is-"
"your-place/5){target=_blank} or consider [paid support options](https://"
"zammad.com/en/services/professional-services){target=_blank}."
msgstr ""
"Dies ist nur eine Beschreibung der grundlegenden Schritte zur Durchführung "
"einer Migration auf einen neuen Host. Ihre Umgebung kann anders sein, daher "
"sollten Sie dies nur als Anhaltspunkt betrachten. Wenn etwas schief geht, "
"wenden Sie sich bitte an die [Zammad Community](https://community.zammad.org/"
"c/trouble-running-zammad-this-is-your-place/5){target=_blank} oder ziehen "
"Sie [bezahlte Support-Optionen](https://zammad.com/de/services/professional-"
"services){target=_blank} in Betracht."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:18
msgid ""
"The steps described on this page are an addition to the [backup and restore "
"guide](/en/tutorials/backup-restore). They're not meant to stand alone - "
"we'll link and note this in the relevant parts."
msgstr ""
"Die auf dieser Seite beschriebenen Schritte sind eine Ergänzung zur "
"[Anleitung zur Sicherung und Wiederherstellung](/de/tutorials/backup-"
"restore). Sie sind nicht dazu gedacht, für sich allein zu stehen - wir "
"verlinken und vermerken dies an den entsprechenden Stellen."

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Migrating from Zammad SaaS? Skip to\n"
"[Step 7](#step-7-transfer-your-backup-files). For restoration, you've\n"
"received an attachment dump!\n"
msgstr ""
"Migration von Zammad SaaS? Springen Sie zu\n"
"[Schritt 7](#schritt-7-transfer-der-backup-dateien). Zur Wiederherstellung haben Sie\n"
"einen Anhang-Dump erhalten!\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Note Down Your Environmental Adjustments"
msgstr "Schritt 1: Notieren Sie Ihre Umgebungseinstellungen"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:28
msgid ""
"If you have set any environment variables or similar, make sure to backup "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Falls Sie Umgebungsvariablen oder ähnliches gesetzt haben, sollten Sie diese "
"nun sichern."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Install Zammad on the Destination Host"
msgstr "Schritt 2: Installieren Sie Zammad auf dem Zielhost"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:35
msgid ""
"For the easiest restoration path possible, please install the same version "
"like your origin instance. You could also consider updating the old instance "
"before migrating. The following guide assumes that you have the same version "
"of Zammad on your old and new host."
msgstr ""
"Um die Wiederherstellung so einfach wie möglich zu gestalten, installieren "
"Sie bitte die gleiche Version wie Ihre Ursprungsinstanz. Sie können ggf. "
"erwägen, die alte Instanz vor der Migration zu aktualisieren. Die folgende "
"Anleitung geht davon aus, dass Sie die gleiche Version von Zammad auf Ihrem "
"alten und neuen Host haben."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Activate Maintenance Mode"
msgstr "Schritt 3: Aktivieren des Wartungsmodus"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This ends all agent and customer sessions. Activate it in Zammad's admin\n"
"interface under _System > Maintenance_.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dadurch werden alle Sitzungen von Agenten und Kunden beendet. Aktivieren Sie es in Zammads Admin\n"
"Bereich unter _System > Wartung_.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Disable Your Communication Channels"
msgstr "Schritt 4: Deaktivieren Sie Ihre Kommunikationskanäle"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:45
msgid ""
"The restore script starts Zammad automatically, this may help to avoid data "
"loss and inconsistencies."
msgstr ""
"Das Wiederherstellungsskript startet Zammad automatisch. Das Deaktivieren "
"trägt dazu bei, Datenverluste und Inkonsistenzen zu vermeiden."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 5: Stop and Disable Zammad"
msgstr "Schritt 5: Zammad beenden und deaktivieren"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:49
msgid "Make sure that no data will be changed _before_ backing up."
msgstr ""
"Stellen Sie sicher, dass keine Daten _vor_ der Sicherung geändert werden."

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo systemctl disable zammad\n"
msgstr "sudo systemctl disable zammad\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 6: Backup"
msgstr "Schritt 6: Sicherung"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:62
msgid ""
"Follow the [backup guide](/en/tutorials/backup-restore#) to create your "
"backup."
msgstr ""
"Folgen Sie der [Backup Anleitung](/de/tutorials/backup-restore#), um Ihre "
"Sicherung zu erstellen."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:65
msgid ""
"Remember if you've created a full filesystem dump or only backed up your "
"data. This will be important for the restoration."
msgstr ""
"Merken Sie sich, ob Sie ein vollständigen Dateisystem-Dump erstellt oder nur "
"Ihre Daten gesichert haben. Dies ist für die Wiederherstellung wichtig."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:67
msgid "If you want to go the easiest way, consider only dumping your data."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie den einfachsten Weg gehen wollen, erwägen Sie nur Ihre Daten zu "
"sichern."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 7: Transfer Your Backup Files"
msgstr "Schritt 7: Transfer der Backup Dateien"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:74
msgid ""
"Save your backup files in a directory and provide the path to the `config` "
"file. Under [backup configuration](/en/tutorials/backup-restore#backup-"
"configuration) you can find how to adjust the config file to your needs."
msgstr ""
"Speichern Sie Ihre Sicherungsdateien in einem Verzeichnis und geben Sie den "
"Pfad in der Datei `config` an. Unter [Backup-Konfiguration](/de/tutorials/"
"backup-restore#backup-konfiguration) erfahren Sie, wie Sie die "
"Konfigurationsdatei an Ihre Bedürfnisse anpassen können."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 8: Restore Your Backup"
msgstr "Schritt 8: Wiederherstellung der Sicherung"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:79
msgid ""
"Follow the [restoration guide](/en/tutorials/backup-restore#restore-"
"backups)  up to and including \"Run the Restore\" to restore the backup on "
"the new host."
msgstr ""
"Folgen Sie der [Wiederherstellungsanleitung](/de/tutorials/backup-"
"restore#backup-wiederherstellen) bis einschließlich \"Backup "
"wiederherstellen\", um die Sicherung auf dem neuen Host wiederherzustellen."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:81
msgid "Make sure to stop Zammad after the restoration has finished."
msgstr ""
"Stellen Sie sicher, dass Sie Zammad nach Abschluss der Wiederherstellung "
"beenden."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9: Run Required Maintenance Tasks After Restoring"
msgstr "Schritt 9: Erforderliche Wartungsaufgaben nach der Wiederherstellung ausführen"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:86
msgid ""
"After successful restoration, please continue below depending if you've only "
"backed up your data or have a full filesystem dump."
msgstr ""
"Nach erfolgreicher Wiederherstellung fahren Sie bitte unten fort, abhängig "
"davon, ob Sie nur Ihre Daten gesichert haben oder eine vollständige "
"Dateisystem-Sicherung haben."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "Data Dump"
msgstr "Daten-Sicherung"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9.1: Clear the cache"
msgstr "Schritt 9.1: Löschen Sie den Cache"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:91 src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:157
#, no-wrap
msgid "zammad run rails r \"Rails.cache.clear\"\n"
msgstr "zammad run rails r \"Rails.cache.clear\"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "Full Filesystem Dump"
msgstr "Vollständige Dateisystem-Sicherung"

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:97
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This step is only needed, if one of the following points is met:\n"
"\n"
"- The source and destination Zammad versions are not the same\n"
"- The Zammad installation is not a source code installation\n"
"- The Zammad backup is not an export from our hosted setup\n"
"\n"
"Full dumps for source code installations are not covered, however,\n"
"basically the same below applies to you: You have to ensure that the\n"
"environments and application files are overwritten with the new /\n"
"correct version.\n"
"\n"
"Zammad files are distribution and version specific!\n"
msgstr ""
"Dieser Schritt ist nur erforderlich, wenn einer der folgenden Punkte erfüllt ist:\n"
"\n"
"- Die Quell- und Zielversion von Zammad sind nicht identisch\n"
"- Die Zammad-Installation ist keine Quellcode-Installation\n"
"- Das Zammad-Backup ist kein Export von unserer gehosteten Installation\n"
"\n"
"Vollständige Sicherungen für Quellcode-Installationen sind jedoch nicht abgedeckt,\n"
"Grundsätzlich gilt für Sie das Gleiche wie unten: Sie müssen sicherstellen, dass die\n"
"Umgebungen und Anwendungsdateien mit der neuen / richtigen\n"
"Version überschrieben werden.\n"
"\n"
"Zammad-Dateien sind distributions- und versionsspezifisch!\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9.1: Uninstall and Reinstall Zammad Without Resolving Dependencies"
msgstr "Schritt 9.1: Deinstallation und Neuinstallation von Zammad ohne Auflösen der Abhängigkeiten"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:114
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Debian & Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dpkg -r --force-depends zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"sudo zypper remove -R zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper install zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Debian & Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dpkg -r --force-depends zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"sudo zypper remove -R zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper install zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:138
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You're unsure if above is really required and a mere reinstall would be\n"
"enough? If you run a dedicated install command on for Zammad and receive\n"
"the following, you absolutely have to run above to fix your\n"
"installation.\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"root@zammad:/# apt-get update && apt install zammad\n"
"  Reading package lists... Done\n"
"  Building dependency tree\n"
"  Reading state information... Done\n"
"  zammad is already the newest version (x.x.x-xxxxxx.xxxxxx.xxx).\n"
"  0 upgraded, 0 newly installed, 0 to remove and 0 not upgraded.\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Sie sind sich nicht sicher, ob die oben genannten Maßnahmen wirklich erforderlich sind oder eine einfache Neuinstallation\n"
"ausreicht? Wenn Sie einen Installationsbefehl für Zammad ausführen und\n"
"die folgende Meldung erhalten, müssen Sie unbedingt den obigen Befehl ausführen, um Ihre\n"
"Installation zu reparieren.\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"root@zammad:/# apt-get update && apt install zammad\n"
"  Reading package lists... Done\n"
"  Building dependency tree\n"
"  Reading state information... Done\n"
"  zammad is already the newest version (x.x.x-xxxxxx.xxxxxx.xxx).\n"
"  0 upgraded, 0 newly installed, 0 to remove and 0 not upgraded.\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:155
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9.2: Clear the Cache"
msgstr "Schritt 9.2: Löschen des Cache"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:161
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9.3: Ensure Zammad is Running"
msgstr "Schritt 9.3: Sicherstellen, dass Zammad ausgeführt wird"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:163
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo systemctl status zammad\n"
msgstr "sudo systemctl status zammad\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:168
msgid "If Zammad is not running, run:"
msgstr "Wenn Zammad nicht läuft, führen Sie aus:"

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:173
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Migrated from Zammad SaaS or switching provider?\n"
"\n"
"Please make sure that your email notification channel and\n"
"FQDN configuration is correct.\n"
msgstr ""
"Von Zammad SaaS migriert oder den Anbieter gewechselt?\n"
"\n"
"Bitte stellen Sie sicher, dass Ihr E-Mail-Benachrichtigungskanal und Ihre\n"
"FQDN-Konfiguration korrekt sind.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:180
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 10: Apply Missing Environmental Settings"
msgstr "Schritt 10: Fehlende Umgebungseinstellungen übernehmen"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:184
msgid ""
"If you've set any environmental settings please re-apply your settings now.  "
"You backed them up in [Step 1](#step-1-note-down-your-environmental-"
"adjustments)."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie irgendwelche Umgebungseinstellungen vorgenommen haben, wenden Sie "
"diese jetzt wieder an. Sie haben diese in [Schritt 1](#step-1-notieren-sie-"
"ihre-umgebungseinstellungen) gesichert."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:188
msgid ""
"If not already done, please [install Elasticsearch](/en/tutorials/install-"
"elasticsearch) now and perform the steps to [connect to and configure "
"Elasticsearch](/en/tutorials/connect-config-elasticsearch) after "
"installation."
msgstr ""
"Falls noch nicht geschehen, [installieren Sie Elasticsearch](/de/tutorials/"
"install-elasticsearch) und führen Sie nach der Installation die Schritte für "
"[verbinden und konfigurieren von Elasticsearch](/de/tutorials/connect-config-"
"elasticsearch) aus."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:189
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 11: Re-enable Channels and Deactivate Maintenance Mode"
msgstr "Schritt 11: Kanäle wieder aktivieren und den Wartungsmodus deaktivieren"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:194
msgid ""
"Set the previous deactivated channels back to active if you're sure "
"everything was successful. At this point Zammad will start to _change data_!"
msgstr ""
"Setzen Sie die zuvor deaktivierten Kanäle wieder auf aktiv, wenn Sie sicher "
"sind, dass alles erfolgreich war. An diesem Punkt beginnt Zammad damit "
"_Daten zu ändern_!"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:196
msgid ""
"After verifying the functionality of your channels, allow your agents and "
"customers to log in again by disabling the maintenance mode."
msgstr ""
"Nachdem Sie die Funktionalität Ihrer Kanäle überprüft haben, erlauben Sie "
"Ihren Agenten und Kunden, sich wieder anzumelden, indem Sie den "
"Wartungsmodus deaktivieren."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate to Zammad"
msgstr "Zu Zammad migrieren"

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate To Zammad"
msgstr "Zu Zammad migrieren"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:9
msgid ""
"You can migrate the following data from another ticketing system to Zammad:"
msgstr ""
"Sie können die folgenden Daten von einem anderen Ticket-System zu Zammad "
"migrieren:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:14
msgid "Tickets and their Articles"
msgstr "Tickets und ihre Artikel"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:14
msgid "Groups / Queues"
msgstr "Gruppen / Warteschlangen"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:14
msgid "Organizations"
msgstr "Organisationen"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:14
msgid "Agents and Customers (if applicable)"
msgstr "Agenten und Kunden (falls zutreffend)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After migrating to Zammad, you should first adjust your FQDN settings and HTTP\n"
"type in Zammad's admin interface under _Settings > System > Base_.\n"
"This is important because the getting started wizard is skipped by the\n"
"migration.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nach der Migration zu Zammad sollten Sie zunächst Ihre FQDN-Einstellungen und den HTTP-Typ\n"
"in der Verwaltungsoberfläche von Zammad unter _Einstellungen > System > Basis_ anpassen.\n"
"Dies ist wichtig, da der Einrichtungsassistent bei der Umstellung auf Zammad übersprungen wird.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:23
msgid ""
"After that, you may want to continue with the [First Steps](/en/tutorials/"
"first-steps) to configure Zammad. This has to be done after migration."
msgstr ""
"Danach können Sie mit den [Ersten Schritten](/de/tutorials/first-steps) "
"fortfahren, um Zammad zu konfigurieren. Dies muss nach der Migration "
"durchgeführt werden."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "General Limitations"
msgstr "Allgemeine Einschränkungen"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:29
msgid ""
"There are some general limitations which you can find below. There could "
"also be limitations, depending from which system you are coming. These are "
"covered in the specific sections."
msgstr ""
"Es gibt einige allgemeine Einschränkungen, die Sie unten finden. Je nachdem, "
"von welchem System Sie kommen, kann es auch spezifische Einschränkungen "
"geben. Diese werden in den jeweiligen Abschnitten behandelt."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:31
msgid "General limitations for all migrations:"
msgstr "Allgemeine Einschränkungen für alle Migrationen:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:38
msgid "Migrations are only possible on new instances."
msgstr "Migrationen sind nur auf neuen Instanzen möglich."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:38
msgid ""
"Migrations are only possible from one source. Several migration sources on "
"one instance are not supported."
msgstr ""
"Migrationen sind nur von einer Quelle aus möglich. Mehrere Migrationsquellen "
"auf einer Instanz werden nicht unterstützt."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:38
msgid ""
"Zammad can't migrate object types it doesn't know, migrations will fail."
msgstr ""
"Zammad kann keine Objekttypen migrieren, die es nicht kennt, Migrationen "
"werden fehlschlagen."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:38
msgid ""
"Zammad migrates all or nothing. This means that you can't deselect specific "
"information specific groups, tickets or users."
msgstr ""
"Zammad migriert alles oder nichts. Das bedeutet, dass Sie bestimmte "
"Informationen aus Gruppen, Tickets oder Benutzer nicht abwählen können."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specific Migration Guides"
msgstr "Spezifische Migrationsanleitungen"

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"**Missing a migration source?**\n"
"\n"
"If your system it not mentioned yet, you'll have two options. You can either\n"
"use Zammad's powerful API or drop our\n"
"[sales team a message](https://zammad.com/en/company/contact){target=_blank} for a custom\n"
"development or even migrator sponsoring.\n"
"\n"
"Migrations are available for hosted setups too! Contact support for further\n"
"information!\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"**Fehlt eine Migrationsquelle?**\n"
"\n"
"Wenn Ihr System noch nicht aufgeführt ist, haben Sie zwei Möglichkeiten. Sie können entweder\n"
"die leistungsstarke API von Zammad nutzen oder unserem\n"
"[Vertriebsteam eine Nachricht](https://zammad.com/de/company/contact){target=_blank} schicken für eine kundenspezifische\n"
"Entwicklung oder sogar für das Sponsoring eines Migrations-Features.\n"
"\n"
"Migrationen sind auch für von Zammad gehostete Installationen verfügbar! Kontaktieren Sie den Support für weitere\n"
"Informationen!\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Freshdesk"
msgstr "Freshdesk"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:60 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:204
msgid ""
"Please note Freshdesk specific limitations below. These are additional "
"limitations to the general ones listed."
msgstr ""
"Bitte beachten Sie die folgenden Freshdesk-spezifischen Einschränkungen. "
"Dies sind zusätzliche Einschränkungen zu den allgemein aufgeführten."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:71 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:219
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:480
msgid ""
"Differential migrations are not supported! The general suggestion is to run "
"a test import before to learn how long the migration will take."
msgstr ""
"Differenzielle Migrationen werden nicht unterstützt! Im Allgemeinen wird "
"empfohlen, vorher einen Testimport durchzuführen, um zu erfahren, wie lange "
"die Migration dauern wird."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:71
msgid ""
"Important: Please note that migration speed highly depends on your Freshdesk "
"plan (API rate limits apply)."
msgstr ""
"Wichtig: Bitte beachten Sie, dass die Migrationsgeschwindigkeit stark von "
"Ihrem Freshdesk-Tarif abhängt (es gibt API-Beschränkungen)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:71
msgid ""
"Due to API limitations, Zammad will not show the total number of objects to "
"import, but instead correct them in steps of 100."
msgstr ""
"Aufgrund von API-Beschränkungen zeigt Zammad nicht die Gesamtzahl der zu "
"importierenden Objekte an, sondern korrigiert sie in 100er-Schritten."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:71
msgid ""
"Your Freshdesk plan has to provide API support. This may not apply to all "
"available plans."
msgstr ""
"Ihr Freshdesk-Tarif muss API-Unterstützung bieten. Dies gilt möglicherweise "
"nicht für alle verfügbaren Tarife."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:71 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:219
msgid ""
"User passwords are not migrated and will require the user to use the "
"password reset link on Zammad's login page."
msgstr ""
"Die Passwörter der Benutzer werden nicht migriert und der Benutzer muss den "
"Link zum Zurücksetzen des Passworts auf der Anmeldeseite von Zammad "
"verwenden."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:78
msgid ""
"Zammad requires API access which is why you'll need to [create an API key]"
"(https://support.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/215517-how-to-find-"
"your-api-key){target=_blank} for the migration. The migrator will request "
"your Freshdesk subdomain and API key."
msgstr ""
"Zammad erfordert API-Zugriff, weshalb Sie für die Migration einen [API-"
"Schlüssel](https://support.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/215517-"
"how-to-find-your-api-key){target=_blank} erstellen müssen. Der Migrator wird "
"Ihre Freshdesk-Subdomain und Ihren API-Schlüssel anfordern."

#. type: Fenced div block (warning)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:79 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:488
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Ensure to retrieve the API key with a full administrator account. Less\n"
"privileged users will end in a broken migration.\n"
msgstr ""
"Stellen Sie sicher, dass Sie den API-Schlüssel mit einem vollständigen Administratorkonto abrufen. Weniger\n"
"privilegierte Benutzer führen zu einer fehlerhaften Migration.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:84 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:230
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:389 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:493
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Import"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:89 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:235
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:498
msgid ""
"In general, you have two options on how to migrate data. If you have a "
"fairly big instance with a lot of data, you may want to consider using the "
"console over the browser version."
msgstr ""
"Im Allgemeinen haben Sie zwei Möglichkeiten, wie Sie Daten migrieren können. "
"Wenn Sie eine ziemlich große Instanz mit vielen Daten haben, sollten Sie die "
"Konsole der Browser-Version vorziehen."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:90
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Via Browser\n"
"\n"
"After installing Zammad and\n"
"[configuring your webserver](./webserver-config), navigate to your\n"
"Zammads FQDN in your browser and follow the migration wizard. You can find\n"
"it in the log in screen by clicking the \"Or migrate from another system\"\n"
"link at the bottom.\n"
"\n"
"Depending on the number of users, tickets and Freshdesk plan this may take a\n"
"while.\n"
"\n"
"Seeing the message \"_Interrupted by scheduler restart. Please restart manually\n"
"or wait till next execution time._\"?\n"
"If this message appears after providing your credentials, please be patient.\n"
"The migration should start within 5 minutes.\n"
"\n"
"If you receive above message after the migration begun, please consider using\n"
"the console approach instead and reset the installation.\n"
"\n"
"=== Via Console\n"
"\n"
"Open console:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"zammad run rails c\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Set variables, replace the values in `{}` with your own:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"subdomain = '{freshdesk subdomain}.freshdesk.com'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"token = '{freshdesk token}'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update Zammad settings for freshdesk import:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_freshdesk_endpoint', \"https://#{subdomain}/api/v2\")\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_freshdesk_endpoint_key', token)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_backend', 'freshdesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_mode', true)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Check your configuration in a dry run:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Sequencer.process('Import::Freshdesk::ConnectionTest')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Run the migration:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"job = ImportJob.create(name: 'Import::Freshdesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"AsyncImportJob.perform_later(job)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Per Browser\n"
"\n"
"Nach der Installation von Zammad und der\n"
"[Konfiguration des Webservers](./webserver-config) rufen Sie\n"
"den FQDN in Ihrem Browser auf und folgen dem Migrations-Assistenten. Sie finden\n"
"diesen im Login-Screen, indem Sie auf den Link \"Oder migrieren Sie von einem anderen System\"\n"
"unten klicken.\n"
"\n"
"Abhängig von der Anzahl der Benutzer, Tickets und Ihres Freshdesk-Plans kann dies\n"
"eine Weile dauern.\n"
"\n"
"Sehen Sie die Meldung \"_Interrupted by scheduler restart. Please restart manually\n"
"or wait till next execution time._\"?\n"
"\n"
"Falls diese Meldung erscheint, nachdem Sie Ihre Zugangsdaten eingegeben haben, haben Sie\n"
"bitte ein wenig Geduld. Die Migration sollte innerhalb von 5 Minuten starten.\n"
"\n"
"Falls Sie diese Meldung erscheint, nachdem die Migration bereits begonnen hat, sollten Sie\n"
"es per Konsole versuchen und Ihre Installation zurücksetzen.\n"
"\n"
"=== Per Konsole\n"
"\n"
"Konsole öffnen:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"zammad run rails c\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Variablen definieren. Ersetzen Sie den Wert in Klammern `{}` mit Ihrem eigenen:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"subdomain = '{freshdesk subdomain}.freshdesk.com'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"token = '{freshdesk token}'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Zammad-Einstellungen für Freshdesk-Import aktualisieren:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_freshdesk_endpoint', \"https://#{subdomain}/api/v2\")\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_freshdesk_endpoint_key', token)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_backend', 'freshdesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_mode', true)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Prüfen Sie die Einstellungen in einem Testlauf:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Sequencer.process('Import::Freshdesk::ConnectionTest')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Auführen der Migration:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"job = ImportJob.create(name: 'Import::Freshdesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"AsyncImportJob.perform_later(job)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs|tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:90 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:499
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"Want to see the progress of the migration?\n"
"\n"
"Use\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"pp ImportJob.find_by(name: 'Import::Freshdesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"which gives you an output of the current state of the job.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Möchten Sie den Fortschritt der Migration verfolgen?\n"
"\n"
"Verwenden Sie\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"pp ImportJob.find_by(Name: 'Import::Freshdesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Damit erhalten Sie eine Ausgabe des aktuellen Stands der Aufgabe.\n"
"\n"

