#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Single Sign-on with Kerberos"
msgstr "Single Sign-on mit Kerberos"

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Single Sign-On for Kerberos <Badge type=\"warning\" text=\"on-premise only\"/>"
msgstr "Single Sign-On für Kerberos <Badge type=\"warning\" text=\"on-premise only\"/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:10
msgid ""
"This guide will discuss how to set up single sign-on using Microsoft Active "
"Directory."
msgstr ""
"In dieser Anleitung wird beschrieben, wie Sie Single Sign-On mit Microsoft "
"Active Directory einrichten."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conceptual Overview"
msgstr "Konzeptionelle Übersicht"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:16
msgid ""
"Like every other web application out there, Zammad has its own logic for "
"signing users up, storing their passwords, authenticating them, and managing "
"their sessions."
msgstr ""
"Wie jede andere Webanwendung hat auch Zammad seine eigene Logik, um Benutzer "
"anzumelden, ihre Passwörter zu speichern, sie zu authentifizieren und ihre "
"Sitzungen zu verwalten."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:22
msgid ""
"If your IT department keeps its own user identity store (like Active "
"Directory), Zammad's SSO support allows you to leverage that existing auth "
"system so that anyone with an account on your local intranet will 1) "
"automatically have an account in Zammad and 2) be able to log in with a "
"single click."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Ihre IT-Abteilung ein eigenes System für Benutzeridentitäten (wie "
"Active Directory) unterhält, können Sie mit der SSO-Unterstützung von Zammad "
"dieses bestehende Autorisierungssystem nutzen, so dass jeder, der ein Konto "
"in Ihrer Firma hat, 1) automatisch ein Konto in Zammad hat und 2) sich mit "
"einem einzigen Klick anmelden kann."

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you don't have this IT infrastructure but still want one-click\n"
"login, you can use alternatives like Github, Google, Facebook and more.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie nicht über diese IT-Infrastruktur verfügen, aber trotzdem eine Ein-Klick\n"
"Anmeldung wünschen, können Sie Alternativen wie Github, Google, Facebook und andere nutzen.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "How Does it Work?"
msgstr "Wie funktioniert das?"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:34
msgid ""
"Once enabled, single sign-on activates an endpoint at `https://"
"your.zammad.host/auth/sso`. When the Zammad server receives a GET request at "
"this endpoint with a valid username in **any one of the following** "
"entities, it creates a new session for that user:"
msgstr ""
"Einmal aktiviert, stellt das Single Sign-On Feature einen Endpunkt unter "
"`https://your.zammad.host/auth/sso` bereit. Wenn der Zammad-Server an diesem "
"Endpunkt eine GET-Anfrage mit einem gültigen Benutzernamen in **einer der "
"folgenden** Entitäten erhält, erstellt er eine neue Sitzung für diesen "
"Benutzer:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:38
msgid "an `X-Forwarded-User` request header"
msgstr "einen `X-Forwarded-User` Request Header"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:38
msgid "a `REMOTE_USER` web server environment variable"
msgstr "eine `REMOTE_USER` Webserver Umgebungsvariable"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:38
msgid "an `HTTP_REMOTE_USER` web server environment variable"
msgstr "eine `HTTP_REMOTE_USER` Webserver-Umgebungsvariable"

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Wait. SSO allows you to sign in with only a username?**\n"
"\n"
"In principle, yes.\n"
"\n"
"**How is that okay?**\n"
"\n"
"In this guide, we configure our web server (Apache) to intercept all\n"
"requests to the `/auth/sso` endpoint. Instead of forwarding them to\n"
"Zammad, Apache initiates a three-sided login process (_Kerberos\n"
"authentication_) between the itself, the user, and the Active\n"
"Directory server.\n"
"\n"
"If Active Directory doesn't recognize the user or their password,\n"
"Zammad never sees the request, and the session is never created.\n"
"\n"
"**What does this all mean?**\n"
"\n"
"It means there are many ways you could set up SSO—you don't need to\n"
"follow this guide or even use Active Directory or Kerberos—but if you\n"
"don't know what you're doing, you're going to end up with a _massive_\n"
"security hole.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Moment, mit SSO ist es möglich, sich nur mit einem Benutzernamen anzumelden?**\n"
"\n"
"Im Prinzip ja.\n"
"\n"
"**Wie kann das richtig sein?**\n"
"\n"
"In dieser Anleitung konfigurieren wir unseren Webserver (Apache) so, dass er alle\n"
"Anfragen an den Endpunkt `/auth/sso` abfängt. Anstatt sie an\n"
"Zammad weiterzuleiten, initiiert Apache einen dreiseitigen Anmeldeprozess (_Kerberos\n"
"Authentifizierung_) zwischen ihm selbst, dem Benutzer und dem Active\n"
"Directory-Server.\n"
"\n"
"Wenn Active Directory den Benutzer oder sein Passwort nicht erkennt,\n"
"sieht Zammad die Anfrage nie, und die Sitzung wird nie erstellt.\n"
"\n"
"**Was bedeutet das alles?**\n"
"\n"
"Es bedeutet, dass es viele Möglichkeiten gibt, SSO einzurichten - Sie müssen weder\n"
"diesem Leitfaden folgen noch Active Directory oder Kerberos verwenden. Aber Sie\n"
"sollten unbedingt wissen, was Sie tun. Andernfalls kann leicht eine Sicherheitslücke\n"
"entstehen.\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:65
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Too busy to handle it on your own?**\n"
"\n"
"We've got you covered. Our experts offer custom-tailored workshops to\n"
"get your team up and running fast and with confidence.\n"
"[Just drop us a line](https://zammad.com/contact){target=_blank}!\n"
msgstr ""
"**Zu beschäftigt, um es selbst zu machen?**\n"
"\n"
"Wir sind für Sie da. Unsere Experten bieten maßgeschneiderte Workshops an, damit\n"
"Ihr Team schnell und sicher starten kann. [Schreiben Sie uns einfach eine\n"
"Nachricht](https://zammad.com/contact){target=_blank}!\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:74
msgid "You will need:"
msgstr "Sie benötigen:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:82
msgid "a Microsoft Active Directory environment with"
msgstr "eine Microsoft Active Directory-Umgebung mit"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:82
msgid "root access"
msgstr "Root-Zugang"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:82
msgid "support for AES 256-bit encryption"
msgstr "Unterstützung für AES 256-bit Verschlüsselung"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:82
msgid "a Zammad host with"
msgstr "einen Zammad-Host mit"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:82
msgid "a fully-qualified domain name (FQDN)"
msgstr "einem vollständigen Domänennamen (FQDN)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:82
msgid "some familiarity with system administration (e.g. Apache configuration)"
msgstr "gewisse Kenntnisse in der Systemverwaltung (z.B. Apache-Konfiguration)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:87
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For best results, set up the LDAP integration to make sure\n"
"your Active Directory and Zammad user accounts are always in sync. You\n"
"can find it in Zammad's admin interface under\n"
"_Settings > Security > Third-party Applications_.\n"
msgstr ""
"Am besten richten Sie auch eine LDAP-Integration ein, um sicherzustellen,\n"
"dass Ihre Active Directory- und Zammad-Benutzerkonten immer synchronisiert sind. Sie\n"
"finden Sie in der Verwaltungsoberfläche von Zammad unter\n"
"_Einstellungen > Sicherheit > Anwendungen von Drittanbietern_.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Configure Active Directory"
msgstr "Schritt 1: Konfigurieren Sie Active Directory"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:94
msgid ""
"In the Kerberos authentication scheme, the **authentication server** (Active "
"Directory) needs to maintain shared secrets with the **service** (Zammad). "
"To make this possible, we need to register a **service principal name** "
"(SPN) for Zammad on Active Directory."
msgstr ""
"Im Kerberos-Authentifizierungsschema muss der **Authentifizierungsserver** "
"(Active Directory) gemeinsame Geheimnisse mit dem **Service** (Zammad) "
"verwalten. Um dies zu ermöglichen, müssen wir einen **service principal "
"name** (SPN) für Zammad im Active Directory registrieren."

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "These directions have been confirmed on Windows Server 2016.\n"
msgstr "Diese Anweisungen wurden für Windows Server 2016 bestätigt.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "1a. Create a service account"
msgstr "1a. Erstellen Sie einen Service-Account"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:103
msgid ""
"You may use an existing service account if you have one. Admin privileges "
"are not required; a normal user account will do."
msgstr ""
"Sie können ein bestehendes Konto verwenden, wenn Sie eines haben. Admin-"
"Rechte sind nicht erforderlich; ein normales Benutzerkonto ist ausreichend."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:105
msgid ""
"![Screenshot Active Directory service account settings](/screenshots/sso-"
"kerberos/active-directory-service-account-settings.png)"
msgstr ""
"![Screenshot Active Directory Service Account Einstellungen](/screenshots/"
"sso-kerberos/active-directory-service-account-settings.png)"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "1b. Reset Password"
msgstr "1b. Passwort zurücksetzen"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:110
msgid ""
"Reset service account password after enabling the \"This account supports "
"Kerberos AES 256 bit encryption\"."
msgstr ""
"Passwort des Service Accounts zurücksetzen, nachdem die Option \"This "
"account supports Kerberos AES 256 bit encryption\" aktiviert wurde."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "1c. Register a SPN for Zammad"
msgstr "1c. Registrieren eines SPN für Zammad"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:114 src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:351
msgid "Replace the following placeholders in the commands below:"
msgstr "Ersetzen Sie die folgenden Platzhalter in den nachstehenden Befehlen:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:121 src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:356
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:438
msgid "`<zammad-host>`: Zammad FQDN"
msgstr "`<zammad-host>`: Zammad FQDN"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:121
msgid "`<service-acct>`: Service account logon name"
msgstr "`<service-acct>`: Service-Account Login Name"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:121
msgid ""
"`<password>`: Password of the service account (Option `/pass *` did prove to "
"not work)"
msgstr ""
"`<password>`: Passwort des Service-Accounts (Option `/pass *` hat sich als "
"unbrauchbar erwiesen)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:121 src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:311
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:356 src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:438
msgid "`<domain>`: Windows domain"
msgstr "`<domain>`: Windows Domäne"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:121
msgid "`<master-domain-controller>`: Master domain controller IP/FQD"
msgstr "`<master-domain-controller>`: IP/FQDN des Master Domain Controllers"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:123
msgid "The commands below will prompt for the users password:"
msgstr "Mit den folgenden Befehlen wird das Passwort des Benutzers abgefragt:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:124
#, no-wrap
msgid "setspn -s HTTP/<zammad-host> <service-acct>\n"
msgstr "setspn -s HTTP/<zammad-host> <service-acct>\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:128
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ktpass /princ HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN> \\\n"
"        /mapuser <service-acct> \\\n"
"        /crypto AES256-SHA1 \\\n"
"        /ptype KRB5_NT_PRINCIPAL \\\n"
"        /pass <password> -SetPass +DumpSalt \\\n"
"        /target <master-domain-controller> \\\n"
"        /out zammad.keytab\n"
msgstr ""
"ktpass /princ HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN> \\\n"
"        /mapuser <service-acct> \\\n"
"        /crypto AES256-SHA1 \\\n"
"        /ptype KRB5_NT_PRINCIPAL \\\n"
"        /pass <password> -SetPass +DumpSalt \\\n"
"        /target <master-domain-controller> \\\n"
"        /out zammad.keytab\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:138
#, no-wrap
msgid "1d. Note the secret key and version number"
msgstr "1d. Notieren Sie den geheimen Schlüssel und die Versionsnummer"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:142
msgid ""
"The output of the command above contains important data for Step 2e below:"
msgstr ""
"Die Ausgabe des obigen Befehls enthält wichtige Daten für den folgenden "
"Schritt 2e:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:143
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Using legacy password setting method\n"
"Failed to set property 'servicePrincipalName' to 'HTTP/<zammad-host>' on Dn 'CN=Zammad Service,DC=<domain>,DC=<tld>': 0x13.\n"
"WARNING: Unable to set SPN mapping data.\n"
"If <service-acct> already has an SPN mapping installed for HTTP/<zammad-host>, this is no cause for concern.\n"
"Building salt with principalname HTTP/<zammad-host> and domain <domain> (encryption type 18)...\n"
"Hashing password with salt \"<domain><service-acct>\".\n"
"Key created.\n"
"Output keytab to zammad.keytab:\n"
"Keytab version: 0x502\n"
"keysize 67 <service-acct>@<domain> ptype 1 (KRB5_NT_PRINCIPAL) vno 3 etype 0x12 (AES256-SHA1) keylength 32 (0x5ee827c30c736dd4095c9cbe146eabc216415b1ddb134db6aabd61be8fdf7fb1) # [!code focus]\n"
msgstr ""
"Using legacy password setting method\n"
"Failed to set property 'servicePrincipalName' to 'HTTP/<zammad-host>' on Dn 'CN=Zammad Service,DC=<domain>,DC=<tld>': 0x13.\n"
"WARNING: Unable to set SPN mapping data.\n"
"If <service-acct> already has an SPN mapping installed for HTTP/<zammad-host>, this is no cause for concern.\n"
"Building salt with principalname HTTP/<zammad-host> and domain <domain> (encryption type 18)...\n"
"Hashing password with salt \"<domain><service-acct>\".\n"
"Key created.\n"
"Output keytab to zammad.keytab:\n"
"Keytab version: 0x502\n"
"keysize 67 <service-acct>@<domain> ptype 1 (KRB5_NT_PRINCIPAL) vno 3 etype 0x12 (AES256-SHA1) keylength 32 (0x5ee827c30c736dd4095c9cbe146eabc216415b1ddb134db6aabd61be8fdf7fb1) # [!code focus]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:157
msgid "On the last line, take note of:"
msgstr "Die letzte Zeile ist zu beachten:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:160
msgid "the secret key in parentheses at the end (**0x5ee827...**)"
msgstr "den geheimen Schlüssel in Klammern am Ende (**0x5ee827...**)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:160
msgid "the secret key version number preceded by `vno` (**3**)"
msgstr ""
"die Versionsnummer des geheimen Schlüssels mit vorangestelltem `vno` (**3**)"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:161
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Remove NGINX, Set up Apache + Kerberos"
msgstr "Schritt 2: NGINX entfernen, Apache + Kerberos einrichten"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:165
msgid ""
"Next, the Zammad host must be configured to support Kerberos (and to accept "
"auth credentials provided by the Active Directory server)."
msgstr ""
"Als nächstes muss der Zammad-Host so konfiguriert werden, dass er Kerberos "
"unterstützt (und die vom Active Directory-Server bereitgestellten "
"Zugangsdaten akzeptiert)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:169
msgid ""
"In most cases, you would have to recompile NGINX from source with an extra "
"module to enable Kerberos support. To get around this, we will use Apache, "
"which offers Kerberos support through a plug-in module instead."
msgstr ""
"In den meisten Fällen müssten Sie NGINX aus dem Quellcode mit einem "
"zusätzlichen Modul neu kompilieren, um die Kerberos-Unterstützung zu "
"aktivieren. Um dies zu umgehen, werden wir Apache verwenden, der Kerberos-"
"Unterstützung durch ein Plug-in-Modul bietet."

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:170
#, no-wrap
msgid "All commands in this section must be run as root (or with `sudo`).\n"
msgstr "Alle Befehle in diesem Abschnitt müssen als root (oder mit `sudo`) ausgeführt werden.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:174
#, no-wrap
msgid "2a. Turn Off NGINX"
msgstr "2a. NGINX ausschalten"

#. type: Fenced div block (warning)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:176
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This will take your Zammad instance **offline** until Apache is fully\n"
"configured and running.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dadurch ist Ihre Zammad-Instanz **offline**, bis Apache vollständig\n"
"konfiguriert ist und läuft.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:182
msgid "Turn off Nginx:"
msgstr "Nginx stoppen:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:183
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo systemctl stop nginx\n"
msgstr "sudo systemctl stop nginx\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:188
msgid "Keep it off after reboot:"
msgstr "Lassen Sie es nach einem Neustart ausgeschaltet:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:189
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo systemctl disable nginx\n"
msgstr "sudo systemctl disable nginx\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:196
msgid ""
"If you wish to minimize downtime, you can save this step for last; just bear "
"in mind that Apache will not start if the port it wants to listen on is "
"being used by NGINX."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie die Ausfallzeit minimieren möchten, können Sie diesen Schritt zum "
"Schluss ausführen; bedenken Sie jedoch, dass Apache nicht startet, wenn der "
"Port, auf dem gelauscht werden soll, von NGINX verwendet wird."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:199
msgid ""
"If you can't complete this tutorial for any reason, simply turn off Apache "
"and restore NGINX:"
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie dieses Tutorial aus irgendeinem Grund nicht abschließen können, "
"schalten Sie einfach Apache aus und stellen NGINX wieder her:"

#. type: Fenced div block (details)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:200
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl stop apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl disable apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl enable nginx\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl start nginx\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl stop apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl disable apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl enable nginx\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl start nginx\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:220
#, no-wrap
msgid "2b. Pre-Configure Apache"
msgstr "2b. Apache vorkonfigurieren"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:226
msgid ""
"This documentation expects an already working Apache configuration.  You "
"should have a look at the [webserver configuration guide](/en/tutorials/"
"webserver-config) before continuing."
msgstr ""
"Diese Dokumentation setzt eine bereits funktionierende Apache-Konfiguration "
"voraus.  Sie sollten einen Blick in die [Webserver Konfiguration](/de/"
"tutorials/webserver-config) werfen, bevor Sie fortfahren."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:227
#, no-wrap
msgid "2c. Install Further Apache Dependencies"
msgstr "2c. Weitere Apache-Abhängigkeiten installieren"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:229
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Debian & Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install krb5-user libapache2-mod-auth-gssapi\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo yum install krb5-workstation mod_auth_kerb\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper ref\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper install krb5-client apache2-mod_auth_kerb\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Debian & Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install krb5-user libapache2-mod-auth-gssapi\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo yum install krb5-workstation mod_auth_kerb\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper ref\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper install krb5-client apache2-mod_auth_kerb\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:259
#, no-wrap
msgid "2d. Enable Apache Modules"
msgstr "2d. Apache-Module einschalten"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:263
msgid ""
"SSO requires modules that are not enabled by default. By default you can use "
"`a2enmod` to do so."
msgstr ""
"SSO erfordert Module, die standardmäßig nicht aktiviert sind. Standardmäßig "
"können Sie dafür `a2enmod` verwenden."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:264
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== a2enmod (Debian & Ubuntu)\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"a2enmod auth_gssapi rewrite\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== a2enmod (OpenSUSE)\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"a2enmod auth_kerb rewrite\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== via configuration file (CentOS)\n"
"\n"
"add/uncomment the appropriate `LoadModule` statements in your Apache\n"
"config:\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"# /etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf\n"
"\n"
"LoadModule auth_kerb_module /usr/lib/apache2/modules/mod_auth_kerb.so\n"
"LoadModule rewrite_module modules/mod_rewrite.so\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== a2enmod (Debian & Ubuntu)\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"a2enmod auth_gssapi rewrite\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== a2enmod (OpenSUSE)\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"a2enmod auth_kerb rewrite\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== per Konfigurationsdatei (CentOS)\n"
"\n"
"Ergänzen Sie oder entfernen Sie den Kommentar für `LoadModule` in\n"
"der Apache Konfiguration:\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"# /etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf\n"
"\n"
"LoadModule auth_kerb_module /usr/lib/apache2/modules/mod_auth_kerb.so\n"
"LoadModule rewrite_module modules/mod_rewrite.so\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:300
#, no-wrap
msgid "2e. Configure Kerberos"
msgstr "2e. Kerberos konfigurieren"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:304
msgid ""
"Kerberos realm configuration is how you tell the Zammad server how to reach "
"the _domain controller_ (Active Directory server)."
msgstr ""
"Mit der Kerberos-Realm-Konfiguration teilen Sie dem Zammad-Server mit, wie "
"er den _Domänencontroller_ (Active Directory-Server) erreichen kann."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:306
msgid "Replace the following placeholders in the sample config below:"
msgstr ""
"Ersetzen Sie die folgenden Platzhalter in der untenstehenden "
"Beispielkonfiguration:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:311
msgid "`<domain-controller>`: Domain controller IP/FQDN(s)"
msgstr "`<domain-controller>`: IP/FQDN(s) des Domain-Controllers"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:311
msgid ""
"`<master-domain-controller>`: Master domain controller IP/FQDN (must not be "
"read-only, but can be the same as `<domain-controller>`)"
msgstr ""
"`<master-domain-controller>`: IP/FQDN des Master Domain-Controllers (darf "
"nicht read-only sein; kann identisch zum `<domain-controller>` sein)"

#. type: Fenced code block (ini)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:312
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# /etc/krb5.conf\n"
"\n"
"[libdefaults]\n"
"   default_realm = <DOMAIN>\n"
"\n"
"   default_tkt_enctypes = aes256-cts-hmac-sha1-96\n"
"   default_tgs_enctypes = aes256-cts-hmac-sha1-96\n"
"   permitted_enctypes = aes256-cts-hmac-sha1-96\n"
"\n"
"   kdc_timesync = 1\n"
"   ccache_type = 4\n"
"   forwardable = false\n"
"   proxiable = false\n"
"   fcc-mit-ticketflags = false\n"
"\n"
"[realms]\n"
"         # multiple KDCs ok (one `kdc = ...` definition per line)\n"
"         <DOMAIN> = {\n"
"                  kdc = <domain-controller>\n"
"                  admin_server = <master-domain-controller>\n"
"                  default_domain = <domain>\n"
"\n"
"                  # below is only for GSSAPI\n"
"                  auth_to_local = RULE:[1:$1@$0](.*@<domain>)s/@<domain>$//\n"
"                  auth_to_local = DEFAULT\n"
"         }\n"
"\n"
"[domain_realm]\n"
"         .<domain> = <DOMAIN>\n"
"         <domain> = <DOMAIN>\n"
msgstr ""
"# /etc/krb5.conf\n"
"\n"
"[libdefaults]\n"
"   default_realm = <DOMAIN>\n"
"\n"
"   default_tkt_enctypes = aes256-cts-hmac-sha1-96\n"
"   default_tgs_enctypes = aes256-cts-hmac-sha1-96\n"
"   permitted_enctypes = aes256-cts-hmac-sha1-96\n"
"\n"
"   kdc_timesync = 1\n"
"   ccache_type = 4\n"
"   forwardable = false\n"
"   proxiable = false\n"
"   fcc-mit-ticketflags = false\n"
"\n"
"[realms]\n"
"         # multiple KDCs ok (one `kdc = ...` definition per line)\n"
"         <DOMAIN> = {\n"
"                  kdc = <domain-controller>\n"
"                  admin_server = <master-domain-controller>\n"
"                  default_domain = <domain>\n"
"\n"
"                  # below is only for GSSAPI\n"
"                  auth_to_local = RULE:[1:$1@$0](.*@<domain>)s/@<domain>$//\n"
"                  auth_to_local = DEFAULT\n"
"         }\n"
"\n"
"[domain_realm]\n"
"         .<domain> = <DOMAIN>\n"
"         <domain> = <DOMAIN>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:345
#, no-wrap
msgid "2f. Generate Keytab"
msgstr "2f. Keytab generieren"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:349
msgid ""
"Apache needs a Kerberos _keytab_ (key table) to manage its shared secrets "
"with the domain controller."
msgstr ""
"Apache benötigt eine Kerberos _keytab_ (Schlüsseltabelle), um seine "
"gemeinsamen Geheimnisse mit dem Domain Controller zu verwalten."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:356
msgid "`<secret-key>`: Secret key (**omit the leading** `0x`)"
msgstr ""
"`<secret-key>`: Geheimer Schlüssel (**lassen Sie die führende** `0x` **weg**)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:356
msgid "`<vno>`: Secret key version number"
msgstr "`<vno>`: Versionsnummer des geheimen Schlüssels"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:359
msgid ""
"The secret key and version number were found in `sso-register-spn` (Step "
"1d)  above."
msgstr ""
"Der geheime Schlüssel und die Versionsnummer wurden in `sso-register-spn` "
"(Schritt 1d) oben ermittelt."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:361
msgid "Enter ktutil:"
msgstr "Führen Sie ktutil aus:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:362
#, no-wrap
msgid "ktutil\n"
msgstr "ktutil\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:367
msgid "Add keytab:"
msgstr "Keytab hinzufügen:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:368
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ktutil: addent -key -p HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN> -k <vno> -e aes256-cts\n"
"Key for HTTP/<zammad-host>@<domain> (hex): <secret-key>\n"
msgstr ""
"ktutil: addent -key -p HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN> -k <vno> -e aes256-cts\n"
"Key for HTTP/<zammad-host>@<domain> (hex): <secret-key>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:374
msgid "Confirm the entry was added successfully:"
msgstr "Prüfen Sie, ob der Eintrag erfolgreich hinzugefügt wurde:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:375
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ktutil: list\n"
"slot KVNO Principal\n"
"---- ---- ---------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"   1    3 HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>\n"
msgstr ""
"ktutil: list\n"
"slot KVNO Principal\n"
"---- ---- ---------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"   1    3 HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:383
msgid "Write keytab to disk:"
msgstr "Keytab speichern:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:384
#, no-wrap
msgid "ktutil: wkt /root/zammad.keytab\n"
msgstr "ktutil: wkt /root/zammad.keytab\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:389
msgid "Leave ktutil:"
msgstr "Verlassen Sie ktutil:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:390
#, no-wrap
msgid "ktutil: quit\n"
msgstr "ktutil: quit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:396
msgid ""
"Then, place the keytab in the Apache config directory and set the "
"appropriate permissions:"
msgstr ""
"Legen Sie die keytab in das Apache-Konfigurationsverzeichnis und setzen Sie "
"die entsprechenden Berechtigungen:"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:397
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Debian, Ubuntu, OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo mv /root/zammad.keytab /etc/apache2/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chown root:www-data /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chmod 640 /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo mv /root/zammad.keytab /etc/httpd/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chown root:apache /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chmod 640 /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Debian, Ubuntu, OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo mv /root/zammad.keytab /etc/apache2/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chown root:www-data /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chmod 640 /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo mv /root/zammad.keytab /etc/httpd/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chown root:apache /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chmod 640 /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:429
#, no-wrap
msgid "2g. Configure Apache"
msgstr "2g. Apache konfigurieren"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:433
msgid ""
"Add the following directive to the end of the virtual host configuration "
"file to create your Kerberos SSO endpoint at `/auth/sso`:"
msgstr ""
"Fügen Sie die folgende Parameter am Ende der Konfigurationsdatei des "
"virtuellen Hosts hinzu, um Ihren Kerberos-SSO-Endpunkt unter `/auth/sso` zu "
"erstellen:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:435
msgid "Replace the following placeholders in the command below:"
msgstr "Ersetzen Sie die folgenden Platzhalter in dem unten stehenden Befehl:"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:439
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Debian & Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"``` apache\n"
"# /etc/apache2/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"\n"
"<LocationMatch \"/auth/sso\">\n"
"   SSLRequireSSL\n"
"   AuthType GSSAPI\n"
"   AuthName \"Your Zammad\"\n"
"   GssapiBasicAuth On\n"
"   GssapiCredStore keytab:/etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"   GssapiLocalName On\n"
"   require valid-user\n"
"\n"
"   RewriteEngine On\n"
"   RewriteCond %{LA-U:REMOTE_USER} (.+)\n"
"   RewriteRule . - [E=RU:%1,NS]\n"
"   RequestHeader set X-Forwarded-User \"%{RU}e\" env=RU\n"
"</LocationMatch>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS & OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"The configuration for CentOS and OpenSUSE below contains two\n"
"`Krb5KeyTab` lines! Keep only the one you need.\n"
"\n"
"``` apache\n"
"# /etc/apache2/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"\n"
"<LocationMatch \"/auth/sso\">\n"
"   SSLRequireSSL\n"
"   AuthType Kerberos\n"
"   AuthName \"Your Zammad\"\n"
"   KrbMethodNegotiate On\n"
"   KrbVerifyKDC On\n"
"   KrbMethodK5Passwd On\n"
"   KrbAuthRealms <DOMAIN>\n"
"   KrbLocalUserMapping on                 # strips @REALM suffix from REMOTE_USER variable\n"
"   KrbServiceName HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>\n"
"   Krb5KeyTab /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab  # Ubuntu, Debian, & openSUSE\n"
"   Krb5KeyTab /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab    # CentOS\n"
"   require valid-user\n"
"\n"
"   RewriteEngine On\n"
"   RewriteCond %{LA-U:REMOTE_USER} (.+)\n"
"   RewriteRule . - [E=RU:%1,NS]\n"
"   RequestHeader set X-Forwarded-User \"%{RU}e\" env=RU\n"
"</LocationMatch>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Debian & Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"# /etc/apache2/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"\n"
"<LocationMatch \"/auth/sso\">\n"
"   SSLRequireSSL\n"
"   AuthType GSSAPI\n"
"   AuthName \"Your Zammad\"\n"
"   GssapiBasicAuth On\n"
"   GssapiCredStore keytab:/etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"   GssapiLocalName On\n"
"   require valid-user\n"
"\n"
"   RewriteEngine On\n"
"   RewriteCond %{LA-U:REMOTE_USER} (.+)\n"
"   RewriteRule . - [E=RU:%1,NS]\n"
"   RequestHeader set X-Forwarded-User \"%{RU}e\" env=RU\n"
"</LocationMatch>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS & OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"The configuration for CentOS and OpenSUSE below contains two\n"
"`Krb5KeyTab` lines! Keep only the one you need.\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"# /etc/apache2/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"\n"
"<LocationMatch \"/auth/sso\">\n"
"   SSLRequireSSL\n"
"   AuthType Kerberos\n"
"   AuthName \"Your Zammad\"\n"
"   KrbMethodNegotiate On\n"
"   KrbVerifyKDC On\n"
"   KrbMethodK5Passwd On\n"
"   KrbAuthRealms <DOMAIN>\n"
"   KrbLocalUserMapping on                 # strips @REALM suffix from REMOTE_USER variable\n"
"   KrbServiceName HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>\n"
"   Krb5KeyTab /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab  # Ubuntu, Debian, & openSUSE\n"
"   Krb5KeyTab /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab    # CentOS\n"
"   require valid-user\n"
"\n"
"   RewriteEngine On\n"
"   RewriteCond %{LA-U:REMOTE_USER} (.+)\n"
"   RewriteRule . - [E=RU:%1,NS]\n"
"   RequestHeader set X-Forwarded-User \"%{RU}e\" env=RU\n"
"</LocationMatch>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:493
#, no-wrap
msgid "2g. Restart Apache to Apply Changes"
msgstr "2g. Apache neu starten, um Änderungen zu übernehmen"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:495
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:176
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
msgstr "sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:499
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Enable SSO in Zammad"
msgstr "Schritt 3: Aktivieren Sie SSO in Zammad"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:503
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, enable \"Authentication via SSO\" in Zammad's Admin Panel under\n"
"_Settings > Security > Third-Party Applications_\n"
msgstr ""
"Als Nächstes aktivieren Sie \"Anmeldung über SSO\" in Zammads Admin Bereich unter\n"
"_Einstellungen > Sicherheit > Anwendungen von Drittanbietern_.\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:504
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On older versions of Zammad, visit `https://your.zammad.host/auth/sso`\n"
"to sign in.\n"
msgstr ""
"Öffnen Sie bei älteren Versionen von Zammad `https://your.zammad.host/auth/sso`,\n"
"um sich anzumelden.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:509
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Configure Client System (Windows Only)"
msgstr "Schritt 4: Client-System konfigurieren (nur Windows)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:513
msgid ""
"For the full SSO experience (i.e. for passwordless one-click sign-in), "
"Zammad users must:"
msgstr ""
"Für die vollständige SSO-Erfahrung (d.h. für die passwortlose Anmeldung mit "
"einem Klick) müssen Benutzer von Zammad:"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:517
msgid "be on the Active Directory server's local intranet; and"
msgstr "sich im lokalen Intranet des Active Directory-Servers befinden; und"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:517
msgid ""
"modify their network settings for the Zammad host to be treated as a local "
"intranet server."
msgstr ""
"ihre Netzwerkeinstellungen so ändern, dass der Zammad-Host wie ein lokaler "
"Intranet-Server behandelt wird."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:520
msgid ""
"Without this step, users must enter their Active Directory credentials "
"during SSO."
msgstr ""
"Ohne diesen Schritt müssen die Benutzer ihre Zugangsdaten für Active "
"Directory während des SSO eingeben."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:521
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== IE / Edge / Chromium\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== IE / Edge / Chromium\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs|tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:521
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This setting can be centrally managed across the entire intranet using\n"
"a **group policy object** (GPO).\n"
msgstr ""
"Diese Einstellung kann zentral für das gesamte Intranet verwaltet werden, indem\n"
"ein **Gruppenrichtlinienobjekt** (GPO) verwendet wird.\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs|tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:521
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"1. Add your Zammad FQDN in Internet Options under _Security > Local\n"
"   Intranet > Sites > Advanced_.\n"
"2. Select \"Require server verification (https:) for all sites in this\n"
"   zone\".\n"
"3. Under _Security level for this zone > Custom level... > Settings\n"
"   \\> User Authentication > Logon_, select \"Automatic logon only in\n"
"   Intranet Zone\".\n"
"\n"
"=== Firefox\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"1. Fügen Sie Ihren Zammad FQDN in den Internetoptionen unter _Security > Local\n"
"   Intranet > Sites > Advanced_ hinzu.\n"
"2. Wählen Sie \"Require server verification (https:) for all sites in this\n"
"   zone\"\n"
"3. Wählen Sie unter _Security level for this zone > Custom level... > Settings\n"
"   \\> User Authentication > Logon_ die Option \"Automatic logon only in\n"
"   Intranet Zone\".\n"
"\n"
"=== Firefox\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs|info)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:521
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This option cannot be centrally managed because it is set in the\n"
"browser rather than Windows Settings.\n"
msgstr ""
"Diese Option kann nicht zentral verwaltet werden, da sie im\n"
"Browser und nicht in den Windows-Einstellungen festgelegt wird.\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:521
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"1. Enter `about:config` in the address bar. Click **Accept the risk and\n"
"   continue**.\n"
"2. Search for the `network.negotiate-auth.trusted-uris` option.\n"
"3. Double-click to edit, then add your Zammad FQDN.\n"
"4. Restart Firefox to apply your changes.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"1. Geben Sie `about:config` in die Adressleiste ein. Klicken Sie auf **Das Risiko akzeptieren und\n"
"   fortfahren**.\n"
"2. Suchen Sie nach der Option `network.negotiate-auth.trusted-uris`.\n"
"3. Doppelklicken Sie darauf, um sie zu bearbeiten, und fügen Sie Ihren Zammad FQDN hinzu.\n"
"4. Starten Sie Firefox neu, damit Ihre Änderungen wirksam sind.\n"
"\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:560
msgid ""
"Are all relevant FQDNs/hostnames reachable from your Active Directory and "
"Zammad servers (including each other's)?"
msgstr ""
"Sind alle relevanten FQDNs/Hostnamen von Ihren Active Directory- und Zammad-"
"Servern (auch die beiden gegenseitig) erreichbar?"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:560
msgid ""
"Are the system clocks of your Active Directory and Zammad servers "
"synchronized within five minutes of each other? Kerberos is a time-sensitive "
"protocol!"
msgstr ""
"Sind die Systemuhren Ihrer Active Directory- und Zammad-Server innerhalb von "
"fünf Minuten zueinander synchronisiert? Kerberos ist ein zeitkritisches "
"Protokoll!"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:561
#, no-wrap
msgid "Errors in Apache Logs"
msgstr "Fehler in Apache-Protokollen"

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:563
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Try raising your Apache log level temporarily.**\n"
"\n"
"Add `LogLevel debug` to your virtual host configuration, then restart\n"
"the service to apply the changes.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Versuchen Sie, das Apache-Log-Level vorübergehend zu erhöhen.**\n"
"\n"
"Fügen Sie `LogLevel debug` zur Konfiguration Ihres virtuellen Hosts hinzu und starten Sie dann\n"
"den Dienst neu, um die Änderungen zu übernehmen.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:570
#, no-wrap
msgid "An unsupported mechanism was requested"
msgstr "An unsupported mechanism was requested"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:574
msgid ""
"Does your Active Directory service account have **Kerberos AES 256-bit "
"encryption** enabled?"
msgstr ""
"Ist in Ihrem Active Directory-Serviceaccount die **Kerberos AES 256-bit "
"encryption** aktiviert?"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:578
msgid ""
"If for some reason your server does not support AES 256-bit encryption, the "
"LDAP Wiki has [more information about Kerberos encryption types](https://"
"ldapwiki.com/wiki/MsDS-SupportedEncryptionTypes){target=_blank}."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Ihr Server aus irgendeinem Grund keine AES 256-Bit-Verschlüsselung "
"unterstützt, finden Sie im [LDAP-Wiki](https://ldapwiki.com/wiki/MsDS-"
"SupportedEncryptionTypes){target=_blank} weitere Informationen über Kerberos-"
"Verschlüsselungsarten."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:579
#, no-wrap
msgid "Failed to verify krb5 credentials: Key version is not available"
msgstr "Failed to verify krb5 credentials: Key version is not available"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:583
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Did you use the exact **version number** (`vno`) provided by `ktpass`\n"
"when `generating your keytab <sso-generate-keytab>`?\n"
msgstr ""
"Haben Sie die genaue **Versionsnummer** (`vno`) verwendet, die von `ktpass`\n"
"ausgegeben wurde, als Sie Ihre `sso-generate-keytab`-Schlüsseltabelle erzeugt haben?\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:585 src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:592
msgid "Try generating it again, just to be sure."
msgstr "Versuchen Sie sicherheitshalber, sie erneut zu erzeugen."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:586
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unspecified GSS failure. Minor code may provide more information (, No key table entry found for HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN)"
msgstr "Unspecified GSS failure. Minor code may provide more information (, No key table entry found for HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:590
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Does the **service name** you provided to `setspn` exactly match the one\n"
"you used when `generating your keytab <sso-generate-keytab>`?\n"
msgstr ""
"Stimmt der **service name**, den Sie bei `setspn` angegeben haben, genau mit dem überein,\n"
"den Sie beim Generieren Ihrer Keytab `<sso-generate-keytab>` verwendet haben?\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:593
#, no-wrap
msgid "No key table entry found for HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN"
msgstr "No key table entry found for HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:597
msgid ""
"Does your virtual host configuration's `KrbServiceName` setting exactly "
"match the **service name** you provided to `setspn`?"
msgstr ""
"Stimmt die Einstellung `KrbServiceName` Ihrer virtuellen Hostkonfiguration "
"genau mit dem **service name** überein, den Sie in `setspn` angegeben haben?"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:599
msgid "This setting is case-sensitive."
msgstr ""
"Bei dieser Einstellung wird zwischen Groß- und Kleinschreibung unterschieden."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:600
#, no-wrap
msgid "Warning: received token seems to be NTLM, which isn't supported by the Kerberos module. Check your IE configuration"
msgstr "Warning: received token seems to be NTLM, which isn't supported by the Kerberos module. Check your IE configuration"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:604
msgid ""
"Is your Zammad host accessible at an FQDN? This error may indicate that you "
"configured your Zammad host as a numeric IP address instead."
msgstr ""
"Ist Ihr Zammad-Host unter einem FQDN erreichbar? Dieser Fehler kann darauf "
"hinweisen, dass Sie Ihren Zammad-Host stattdessen als IP-Adresse "
"konfiguriert haben."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:605
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cannot decrypt ticket for HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN"
msgstr "Cannot decrypt ticket for HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:609
msgid ""
"Did you make sure to change the password on your Active Directory service "
"account _after enabling 256-bit AES encryption?_"
msgstr ""
"Haben Sie sichergestellt, dass Sie das Passwort für Ihr Konto beim Active "
"Directory-Dienst _nach der Aktivierung der 256-Bit-AES-Verschlüsselung_ "
"geändert haben?"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:612
msgid ""
"And did you make sure to register the SPN (with `ktpass`) and generate your "
"keytab (with `ktutil`) _after changing your password?_"
msgstr ""
"Und haben Sie darauf geachtet, _nach dem Ändern Ihres Passwortes_ den SPN zu "
"registrieren (mit `ktpass`) und Ihre Keytab zu generieren (mit `ktutil`)?"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:618
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Try running `kinit -k -t <path to keytab> HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>`.\n"
"If no output is returned, you're good - if you see \"kinit:\n"
"Preauthentication failed while getting initial credentials\" your\n"
"credentials provided were wrong or you used `/pass *` during ktpass\n"
"command.\n"
msgstr ""
"Versuchen Sie, `kinit -k -t <Pfad zu keytab Schlüsseltabelle> HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>` auszuführen.\n"
"Wenn keine Ausgabe zurückgegeben wird, ist alles gut - wenn Sie \"kinit:\n"
"Preauthentication failed while getting initial credentials\" sehen, waren entweder Ihre\n"
"Zugangsdaten falsch oder Sie haben `/pass *` während des ktpass-Befehls\n"
"verwendet.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:619
#, no-wrap
msgid "Failed when verifying KDC\" and \"failed to verify krb5 credentials: Decrypt integrity check failed"
msgstr "Failed when verifying KDC\" and \"failed to verify krb5 credentials: Decrypt integrity check failed"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:622
msgid "Ensure `KrbServiceName` is the correct ServiceName provided via setspn."
msgstr ""
"Vergewissern Sie sich, dass `KrbServiceName` der richtige, über setspn "
"bereitgestellte ServiceName ist."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:624
msgid "Ensure your Active Directory supports the encryption method configured."
msgstr ""
"Stellen Sie sicher, dass Ihr Active Directory die konfigurierte "
"Verschlüsselungsmethode unterstützt."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:627
msgid ""
"If all above is correct and the rest of FAQ also is ensured, make sure your "
"client does not cache the results. `klist purge` clears the clients cache - "
"a reboot of your client would do too."
msgstr ""
"Wenn alles oben genannte korrekt ist und Sie die Anleitung befolgt haben, "
"stellen Sie sicher, dass Ihr Client die Ergebnisse nicht im Cache speichert. "
"`klist purge` löscht den Cache des Clients - alternativ können Sie auch "
"einen Neustart des Clients durchführen."

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Webserver Configuration"
msgstr "Webserver-Konfiguration"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:13
msgid ""
"This guide is only relevant for package installations. During the "
"installation, Zammad tries to automatically install a configuration file to "
"your Nginx.  You can find example configuration files for your webserver in "
"the `contrib/` directory of your Zammad installation."
msgstr ""
"Diese Anleitung ist nur für Paket-Installationen relevant. Während der "
"Installation versucht Zammad, automatisch eine Konfigurationsdatei für Ihren "
"Nginx zu installieren.  Sie finden Beispielkonfigurationsdateien für Ihren "
"Webserver im Verzeichnis `contrib/` Ihrer Zammad-Installation."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:17
msgid ""
"In case this out-of-the-box approach doesn't work for you, you can find some "
"hints for your configuration. You can use either Nginx or Apache 2 (only "
"referred to as Apache in the following text)."
msgstr ""
"Für den Fall, dass dieser Standardansatz bei Ihnen nicht funktioniert, "
"finden Sie hier einige Hinweise für Ihre Konfiguration. Sie können entweder "
"Nginx oder Apache 2 (im folgenden Text nur als Apache bezeichnet) verwenden."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get a SSL Certificate"
msgstr "SSL-Zertifikat anfordern"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:24
msgid ""
"You have to use a named configuration which is not configured by default. To "
"fix this, open the `zammad.conf` in your webserver's config directory and "
"replace the `server_name localhost` (Nginx) or `ServerName localhost` "
"(Apache)  with your Zammad domain."
msgstr ""
"Sie müssen eine benannte Konfiguration verwenden, die standardmäßig nicht "
"eingerichtet ist. Um dies zu tun, öffnen Sie die `zammad.conf` im "
"Konfigurationsverzeichnis Ihres Webservers und ersetzen Sie den `server_name "
"localhost` (Nginx) oder den `ServerName localhost` (Apache) durch Ihre "
"Zammad-Domain."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:26
msgid "The config directories are usually:"
msgstr "Die Konfigurationsverzeichnisse sind normalerweise:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:29
msgid ""
"Nginx: `/etc/nginx/conf.d/`, `/etc/nginx/vhosts.d/`, `/etc/nginx/sites-"
"available/`"
msgstr ""
"Nginx: `/etc/nginx/conf.d/`, `/etc/nginx/vhosts.d/`, `/etc/nginx/sites-"
"available/`"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:29
msgid ""
"Apache: `/etc/apache2/conf.d/`, `/etc/httpd/vhosts.d/`, `/etc/apache2/sites-"
"available/`"
msgstr ""
"Apache: `/etc/apache2/conf.d/`, `/etc/httpd/vhosts.d/`, `/etc/apache2/sites-"
"available/`"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let's Encrypt"
msgstr "Let's Encrypt"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:38
msgid ""
"There are two common tools to get certificates, to which your find a basic "
"configuration below: [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/instructions)"
"{target=_blank} and [acme.sh](https://github.com/acmesh-official/acme.sh/"
"wiki){target=_blank}.  Have a look at their documentation for further "
"configuration details and other examples."
msgstr ""
"Es gibt zwei gängige Tools zum Abrufen von Zertifikaten, zu denen Sie unten "
"eine Grundkonfiguration finden: [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/"
"instructions){target=_blank} und [acme.sh](https://github.com/acmesh-"
"official/acme.sh/wiki){target=_blank}. Schauen Sie sich die Dokumentation "
"dieser Tools an, um weitere Konfigurationsdetails und Beispiele zu finden."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"===Certbot\n"
"\n"
"If not happened automatically, you have to install the Nginx or Apache plugin\n"
"for Certbot: `python3-certbot-nginx` or `python3-certbot-apache`\n"
"\n"
"During the first Certbot run it will request additional information once.\n"
"Replace `<webserver>` in below command by either `apache`, `httpd` or\n"
"`nginx` to match your setup.\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"certbot --<webserver> -d zammad.example.com\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Certbot will now attempt to issue a certificate for you. If successful,\n"
"Certbot will ask you if you want to `[1] not redirect` or `[2] redirect`\n"
"automatically. You can choose to not redirect if you plan to use the sample\n"
"configuration of Zammad.\n"
"\n"
"From now on, Certbot will automatically renew your installed certificates if\n"
"they’re valid for 30 days or less.\n"
"\n"
"===acme.sh\n"
"\n"
"Change the default certificate authority to Let's Encrypt:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --set-default-ca  --server letsencrypt\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Issue your certificate and replace `<webserver>` in the following command\n"
"with either `apache` or `nginx` or `standalone` for other webserver.\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --issue --<webserver> -d zammad.example.com\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"It is not recommended to use the stored certificates directly. You should\n"
"install the certificate to a directory of your choice instead as you can see\n"
"in the next command below. We’re using `/etc/ssl/private/` in this case,\n"
"but you can use any directory you like.\n"
"\n"
"Replace `<webserver>` with `apache2`, `httpd` or `nginx`.\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --install-cert -d zammad.example.com \\\n"
"    --cert-file      /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.pem  \\\n"
"    --key-file       /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.key  \\\n"
"    --fullchain-file /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.full.pem \\\n"
"    --reloadcmd     \"sudo systemctl force-reload <webserver>\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"From now on, acme.sh will automatically renew your installed certificates if\n"
"they’re valid for 30 days or less.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"===Certbot\n"
"\n"
"Falls nicht automatisch geschehen, müssen Sie das Nginx- oder Apache-Plugin für Certbot\n"
"installieren:\n"
"`python3-certbot-nginx` oder `python3-certbot-apache`\n"
"\n"
"Während des ersten Certbot-Laufs werden einmalig zusätzliche Informationen abgefragt.\n"
"Ersetzen Sie `<webserver>` im folgenden Befehl entweder durch `apache`, `httpd` oder\n"
"`nginx`, je nach Ihrer Konfiguration.\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"certbot --<webserver> -d zammad.example.com\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Certbot wird nun versuchen, ein Zertifikat für Sie auszustellen. Falls erfolgreich,\n"
"wird Certbot Sie fragen, ob Sie `[1] nicht umleiten` oder automatisch `[2] umleiten` wollen.\n"
"Sie können `nicht umleiten` wählen, wenn Sie unserem Beispiel folgen wollen.\n"
"\n"
"Von nun an erneuert Certbot automatisch Ihre installierten Zertifikate, wenn\n"
"sie noch 30 Tage oder kürzer gültig sind.\n"
"\n"
"===acme.sh\n"
"\n"
"Ändern Sie die Standard-Zertifizierungsstelle in Let's encrypt:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --set-default-ca --server letsencrypt\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Stellen Sie Ihr Zertifikat aus und ersetzen Sie `<webserver>` in dem folgenden Befehl\n"
"entweder durch `apache` oder `nginx` oder `standalone` für andere Webserver.\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --issue --<webserver> -d zammad.example.com\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Es wird nicht empfohlen, die gespeicherten Zertifikate direkt zu verwenden. Sie sollten\n"
"das Zertifikat stattdessen in ein Verzeichnis Ihrer Wahl installieren, wie Sie\n"
"im nächsten Befehl unten sehen können. Wir verwenden in diesem Fall `/etc/ssl/private/`,\n"
"aber Sie können jedes beliebige Verzeichnis verwenden.\n"
"\n"
"Ersetzen Sie `<webserver>` durch `apache2`, `httpd` oder `nginx`.\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --install-cert -d zammad.example.com \\\n"
"    --cert-datei /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.pem \\\n"
"    --key-file /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.key \\\n"
"    --fullchain-file /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.full.pem \\\n"
"    --reloadcmd \"sudo systemctl force-reload <webserver>\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Von nun an erneuert acme.sh automatisch Ihre installierten Zertifikate, wenn\n"
"sie noch 30 Tage oder kürzer gültig sind.\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "Commercial CA"
msgstr "Kommerzielle CA"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:103
msgid ""
"If you prefer to use certificates from a different official Certificate "
"Authority (CA) than Let's Encrypt, you can do so as well. Just get your "
"certificate bundle, install it according to their documentation and continue "
"with adjusting the webserver configuration."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie es vorziehen, Zertifikate von einer anderen offiziellen "
"Zertifizierungsstelle (CA) als Let's Encrypt zu verwenden, können Sie dies "
"ebenfalls tun. Holen Sie sich einfach Ihr Zertifikatspaket, installieren Sie "
"es gemäß der Dokumentation und fahren Sie mit der Anpassung der Webserver-"
"Konfiguration fort."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:104
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjusting the Webserver Configuration"
msgstr "Anpassen der Webserver-Konfiguration"

#. type: Fenced div block (warning)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure to never use HTTP connections - we encourage you to use HTTPS!\n"
msgstr "Stellen Sie sicher, dass Sie niemals HTTP-Verbindungen verwenden - wir empfehlen Ihnen die Verwendung von HTTPS!\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1 - Get a Current Config File"
msgstr "Schritt 1 - Abrufen einer aktuellen Konfigurationsdatei"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:116
msgid ""
"Copy & overwrite the default `zammad.conf`. Adjust your Nginx config "
"directory according to your setup:"
msgstr ""
"Kopieren und überschreiben Sie die Standardkonfiguration `zammad.conf`. "
"Passen Sie Ihr Nginx-Konfigurationsverzeichnis entsprechend Ihrem Setup an:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:117
#, no-wrap
msgid "cp /opt/zammad/contrib/nginx/zammad_ssl.conf /etc/nginx/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
msgstr "cp /opt/zammad/contrib/nginx/zammad_ssl.conf /etc/nginx/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:121
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2 - Adjust the Config File"
msgstr "Schritt 2 - Anpassen der Konfig-Datei"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:124
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:212
msgid ""
"Adjust the just copied file with a text editor of your choice (e.g. vi or "
"nano)."
msgstr ""
"Passen Sie die soeben kopierte Datei mit einem Texteditor Ihrer Wahl (z.B. "
"vi oder nano) an."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:127
msgid ""
"Locate any `server_name` directive and adjust `example.com` to the domain of "
"your Zammad instance."
msgstr ""
"Suchen Sie den `server_name`-Parameter und passen Sie `example.com` an die "
"Domain Ihrer Zammad-Instanz an."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:130
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:218
msgid ""
"Now you'll need to adjust the path and file names for your ssl certificates "
"you obtained. Adjust the following directives to match your setup:"
msgstr ""
"Nun müssen Sie die Pfad- und Dateinamen für die SSL-Zertifikate anpassen, "
"die Sie erhalten haben. Passen Sie die folgenden Parameter an Ihr Setup an:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:134
msgid "`ssl_certificate` (your ssl certificate)"
msgstr "`ssl_certificate` (Ihr SSL-Zertifikat)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:134
msgid "`ssl_certificate_key` (the certificates private key)"
msgstr "`ssl_certificate_key` (der private Schlüssel des Zertifikats)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:134
msgid "`ssl_trusted_certificate` (the public CA certificate)"
msgstr "`ssl_trusted_certificate` (das öffentliche CA-Zertifikat)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:138
msgid ""
"If you don't have a `dhparam.pem` file yet, you can easily adapt the example "
"below to generate this file. You can find the correct path in your webserver "
"config. Search for `ssl_dhparam`."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie noch keine `dhparam.pem`-Datei haben, können Sie das folgende "
"Beispiel leicht anpassen, um diese Datei zu erzeugen. Sie können den "
"korrekten Pfad in Ihrer Webserver-Konfiguration finden. Suchen Sie nach "
"`ssl_dhparam`."

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:139
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:227
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"openssl dhparam -out <path>/dhparam.pem 4096\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"openssl dhparam -out <path>/dhparam.pem 4096\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:144
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3 - Adjust HTTPS Configuration"
msgstr "Schritt 3 - Anpassen der HTTPS-Konfiguration"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:150
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:238
msgid ""
"Our default configuration aims for a broad support of end user devices. This "
"may not fit your needs. Mozilla has a great [ssl-config generator](https://"
"ssl-config.mozilla.org/){target=_blank} that should help you to meet your "
"requirements!"
msgstr ""
"Unsere Standardkonfiguration zielt auf eine breite Unterstützung von "
"Endbenutzer-Geräten ab. Dies entspricht möglicherweise nicht Ihren "
"Anforderungen. Mozilla hat einen großartigen [SSL-Generator](https://ssl-"
"config.mozilla.org/){target=_blank}, der Ihnen helfen sollte, Ihre "
"Anforderungen zu erfüllen!"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:151
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4 - Save & Reload"
msgstr "Schritt 4 - Speichern und neu laden"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:155
msgid ""
"Reload your Nginx with `sudo systemctl reload nginx` to apply your "
"configuration changes."
msgstr ""
"Laden Sie Nginx mit `sudo systemctl reload nginx` neu, um die "
"Konfigurationsänderungen zu übernehmen."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:158
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:284
msgid ""
"After that, you should be greeted by our getting started wizard.  Go on with "
"the [first steps in Zammad](/en/tutorials/first-steps)."
msgstr ""
"Danach sollten Sie von unserem Einrichtungsassistenten begrüßt werden.  "
"Fahren Sie mit den [ersten Schritten in Zammad](/de/tutorials/first-steps) "
"fort."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:159
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apache"
msgstr "Apache"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:161
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1 - Enable Module"
msgstr "Schritt 1 - Modul aktivieren"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:165
msgid ""
"Zammad requires a module (`a2enmod`) which is not enabled by default. CentOS "
"users have to adjust a config file because this module is not available "
"there."
msgstr ""
"Zammad benötigt ein Modul (`a2enmod`), das standardmäßig nicht aktiviert "
"ist. Benutzer von CentOS müssen eine Konfigurationsdatei anpassen, da dieses "
"Modul dort nicht verfügbar ist."

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:166
#, no-wrap
msgid "a2enmod proxy proxy_html proxy_http proxy_wstunnel headers ssl\n"
msgstr "a2enmod proxy proxy_html proxy_http proxy_wstunnel headers ssl\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:171
msgid "If you want to run Zammad under HTTP/2, you will also need:"
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie Zammad unter HTTP/2 laufen lassen möchten, benötigen Sie außerdem:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:172
#, no-wrap
msgid "a2enmod h2 proxy_http2 mpm_event\n"
msgstr "a2enmod h2 proxy_http2 mpm_event\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:181
msgid "Click to open details for CentOS config:"
msgstr "Klicken Sie auf Details, um Infos der CentOS-Konfiguration zu öffnen:"

#. type: Fenced div block (details)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:182
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Add/uncomment the appropriate `LoadModule` statements in your Apache config\n"
"in `/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf`:\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"LoadModule headers_module modules/mod_headers.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_module modules/mod_proxy.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_html_module modules/mod_proxy_html.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_http_module modules/mod_proxy_http.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_wstunnel_module modules/mod_proxy_wstunnel.so\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Restart your webserver after saving the configuration.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Fügen Sie die entsprechenden `LoadModule`-Anweisungen in Ihrer Apache-Konfiguration hinzu bzw. entfernen Sie die Kommentare\n"
"in `/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf`:\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"LoadModule headers_module modules/mod_headers.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_module modules/mod_proxy.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_html_module modules/mod_proxy_html.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_http_module modules/mod_proxy_http.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_wstunnel_module modules/mod_proxy_wstunnel.so\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Starten Sie Ihren Webserver neu, nachdem Sie die Konfiguration gespeichert haben.\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:198
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2 - Get a Current Config File"
msgstr "Schritt 2 - Abrufen einer aktuellen Konfigurationsdatei"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:202
msgid ""
"The package installation copied a `zammad.conf` file to your webserver "
"config directory. Check if it is present and do not rename this file!"
msgstr ""
"Die Paket-Installation hat eine Datei `zammad.conf` in das "
"Konfigurationsverzeichnis Ihres Webservers kopiert. Prüfen Sie, ob sie "
"vorhanden ist und benennen Sie diese Datei nicht um!"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:204
msgid "Adjust your Apache config directory according to your setup:"
msgstr ""
"Passen Sie Ihr Apache-Konfigurationsverzeichnis entsprechend Ihrem Setup an:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:205
#, no-wrap
msgid "ls /etc/apache2/sites-available\n"
msgstr "ls /etc/apache2/sites-available\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:209
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3 - Adjust the Config File"
msgstr "Schritt 3 - Anpassen der Konfig-Datei"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:215
msgid ""
"Locate any `ServerName` directive and adjust `example.com` to the domain of "
"your Zammad instance."
msgstr ""
"Suchen Sie einen `ServerName`-Parameter und passen Sie `example.com` an die "
"Domain Ihrer Zammad-Instanz an."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:222
msgid "`SSLCertificateFile` (your ssl certificate)"
msgstr "`SSLCertificateFile` (Ihr SSL-Zertifikat)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:222
msgid "`SSLCertificateKeyFile`(the certificates private key)"
msgstr "`SSLCertificateKeyFile` (der private Schlüssel des Zertifikats)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:222
msgid "`SSLCertificateChainFile` (the public CA certificate)"
msgstr "`SSLCertificateChainFile` (das öffentliche CA-Zertifikat)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:226
msgid ""
"If you don't have a `dhparam.pem` file yet, you can easily adapt the example "
"below to generate this file. You can find the correct path in your webserver "
"config. Search for `SSLOpenSSLConfCmd DHParameters`."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie noch keine `dhparam.pem`-Datei haben, können Sie das folgende "
"Beispiel leicht anpassen, um diese Datei zu erzeugen. Sie können den "
"korrekten Pfad in Ihrer Webserverkonfiguration finden. Suchen Sie nach "
"`SSLOpenSSLConfCmd DHParameters`."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:232
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4 - Adjust HTTPS Configuration"
msgstr "Schritt 4 - Anpassen der HTTPS-Konfiguration"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:239
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 5 - Enable the Site"
msgstr "Schritt 5 - Aktivieren der Website"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:243
msgid ""
"This step mostly depends on your selected folders and should only affect "
"`sites-available` folders."
msgstr ""
"Dieser Schritt hängt größtenteils von den ausgewählten Ordnern ab und sollte "
"nur die `sites-available`-Ordner betreffen."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:244
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu, Debian, OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"Make sure the following line is present in your Apache config\n"
"(`/etc/apache2/apache2.conf`):\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"IncludeOptional sites-enabled/*.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Enable it:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"a2ensite zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"Make sure the following line is present in your Apache config\n"
"(`/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf`):\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"IncludeOptional sites-enabled/*.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Enable it:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"ln -s /etc/httpd/sites-available/zammad_ssl.conf /etc/httpd/sites-enabled/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu, Debian, OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"Stellen Sie sicher, dass die folgende Zeile in Ihrer Apache-Konfiguration (``/etc/apache2/apache2.conf``)\n"
"vorhanden ist:\n"
"\n"
"```\n"
"IncludeOptional sites-enabled/*.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Aktivieren Sie es:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"a2ensite zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"Stellen Sie sicher, dass die folgende Zeile in Ihrer Apache-Konfiguration (``/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf``)\n"
"vorhanden ist:\n"
"\n"
"```\n"
"IncludeOptional sites-enabled/*.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Aktivieren Sie es:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"ln -s /etc/httpd/sites-available/zammad_ssl.conf /etc/httpd/sites-enabled/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:278
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 6 - Save & Reload"
msgstr "Schritt 6 - Speichern und neu laden"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:282
msgid ""
"Reload your Apache with `sudo systemctl reload apache2` to apply your "
"configuration changes."
msgstr ""
"Laden Sie Ihren Apache mit `sudo systemctl reload apache2` neu, um Ihre "
"Konfigurationsänderungen zu übernehmen."

